+"""Exp 4088 trustworthy ARC verifier-reward RFT corpus build.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-LEARN-4088, SCENARIO-LEARN-4088-BLOCKED,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-4088-NMATCH, SCENARIO-LEARN-4088-SMOKE.
